    "flavor_text": {
        "sun": "Each of its heads has its own will. They use telepathy to discuss their plans before coming to a joint decision.",
        "moon": "When the time comes, one of its three heads falls off. Before long, the fallen head grows into an Exeggcute.",
        "ultra-sun": "It engages its enemies using psychic powers. Each of its three heads fires off psychokinetic energy, tripling its power.",
        "ultra-moon": "Each of its three heads has its own thoughts. When they want to go in different directions, Exeggutor becomes unable to move.",
        "lets-go-pikachu": "Its cries are very noisy. This is because each of the three heads thinks about whatever it likes.",
        "lets-go-eevee": "Its cries are very noisy. This is because each of the three heads thinks about whatever it likes."
    },
